@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Streaming user-preference import
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "userpreferencejob" {
  class UserPreferenceApplication {
    + {static} void main(String[])
  }
  class UserPreferenceStartupImporter {
    + void run(ApplicationArguments)
  }
  class StreamingUserPreferenceImporter {
    + Result run(Path,Path)
  }
  class UserPreferenceExternalSort {
    ~ void add(Row)
    ~ Path finish(JobProgress)
    + void close()
  }
  interface "CsvRecordConsumer<T>" as CsvRecordConsumer {
    ~ void accept(T)
  }
  class UserFavouriteCsvReader {
    + void read(Path,CsvRecordConsumer<UserFavourite>)
  }
  class UserHistoryCsvReader {
    + void read(Path,CsvRecordConsumer<UserHistory>)
  }
  class UserPreferenceAggregatorService {
    + void aggregateAndSave(List<UserFavourite>,List<UserHistory>)
    + void aggregateAndSave(List<UserFavourite>,List<UserHistory>,Instant)
  }
  class DryRunUserPreferenceRepository
  package model {
    class UserFavourite
    class UserHistory
  }
}
class "catalogue.snapshot.BookVectorSnapshot" as Snapshot
interface "storage.user.port.UserPreferenceVectorRepository" as Profiles

UserPreferenceApplication --> UserPreferenceStartupImporter : startup runner
UserPreferenceStartupImporter --> Snapshot : validate/load
UserPreferenceStartupImporter --> StreamingUserPreferenceImporter
StreamingUserPreferenceImporter --> UserFavouriteCsvReader
StreamingUserPreferenceImporter --> UserHistoryCsvReader
UserFavouriteCsvReader ..> CsvRecordConsumer
UserHistoryCsvReader ..> CsvRecordConsumer
StreamingUserPreferenceImporter --> UserPreferenceExternalSort : bounded runs and merge
StreamingUserPreferenceImporter --> UserPreferenceAggregatorService : whole-user batches; fixed Instant
UserPreferenceAggregatorService --> Snapshot : read vectors from loaded cache
UserPreferenceAggregatorService --> Profiles : save/clear
Profiles <|.. DryRunUserPreferenceRepository

note bottom of StreamingUserPreferenceImporter
  Validate all input before profile writes.
  Favourite duplicates collapse.
  History duplicates keep latest interaction.
  Full snapshot remains in RAM; CSVs do not.
  Explicit write replaces imported users' profiles.
  Dry-run validates output without writes.
end note
@enduml
